# GUI route-following gate for BlueSky navigation and PYBADATEM envelope modes.
# Run with: IC research/pybada-route-speed-gui
00:00:00.00>ECHO TEST INFO === PYBADATEM LARGE-ROUTE GUI COMPARISON ===
00:00:00.05>ECHO TEST INFO ERNV red uses envelope REPORT with LNAV and VNAV ON.
00:00:00.10>ECHO TEST INFO OFNV blue uses envelope OFF with LNAV and VNAV ON.
00:00:00.15>ECHO TEST INFO ERNO red uses envelope REPORT with LNAV and VNAV OFF.
00:00:00.20>ECHO TEST INFO OFNO blue uses envelope OFF with LNAV and VNAV OFF.
00:00:00.25>ECHO TEST INFO BlueSky owns route guidance, waypoint intent, and horizontal speed capture. TEM owns vertical performance.
00:00:00.30>PLUGIN LOAD PYBADATEM
00:00:00.35>PLUGIN LOAD RESEARCHRECORDER
00:00:00.40>PERFMODEL BADA4

# Four aircraft begin on parallel eastbound tracks. Each square is roughly
# 20 by 20 km, about 3 km larger per side than the previous gate. BlueSky's
# default FLYBY turn behavior is intentionally unchanged.
00:00:01.00>CRE ERNV,A320-232,41.160,2.000,90,3000,180
00:00:01.10>CRE OFNV,A320-232,41.200,2.000,90,3000,180
00:00:01.20>CRE ERNO,A320-232,41.240,2.000,90,3000,180
00:00:01.30>CRE OFNO,A320-232,41.280,2.000,90,3000,180
00:00:01.40>DYNAMICS ERNV TEM
00:00:01.45>DYNAMICS OFNV TEM
00:00:01.50>DYNAMICS ERNO TEM
00:00:01.55>DYNAMICS OFNO TEM
00:00:01.60>BADACONFIG ERNV PYBADA
00:00:01.65>BADACONFIG OFNV PYBADA
00:00:01.70>BADACONFIG ERNO PYBADA
00:00:01.75>BADACONFIG OFNO PYBADA
00:00:01.78>RECORDRESEARCH START pybada-route-speed-gui.csv
00:00:01.80>ENVELOPECHECKS ERNV LONGITUDINAL
00:00:01.82>ENVELOPECHECKS ERNO LONGITUDINAL
00:00:01.84>ENVELOPE ERNV REPORT
00:00:01.86>ENVELOPE OFNV OFF
00:00:01.88>ENVELOPE ERNO REPORT
00:00:01.90>ENVELOPE OFNO OFF

# ERNV square: south-west 41.160/2.000, north-east 41.340/2.240.
00:00:02.00>ADDWPT ERNV,41.160,2.240,4000,200
00:00:02.05>ADDWPT ERNV,41.340,2.240,6000,220
00:00:02.10>ADDWPT ERNV,41.340,2.000,5000,190
00:00:02.15>ADDWPT ERNV,41.160,2.000,3000,170
# OFNV square is shifted north by 0.040 degrees.
00:00:02.20>ADDWPT OFNV,41.200,2.240,4000,200
00:00:02.25>ADDWPT OFNV,41.380,2.240,6000,220
00:00:02.30>ADDWPT OFNV,41.380,2.000,5000,190
00:00:02.35>ADDWPT OFNV,41.200,2.000,3000,170
# ERNO and OFNO receive valid routes, but navigation remains explicitly off.
00:00:02.40>ADDWPT ERNO,41.240,2.240,4000,200
00:00:02.45>ADDWPT ERNO,41.420,2.240,6000,220
00:00:02.50>ADDWPT ERNO,41.420,2.000,5000,190
00:00:02.55>ADDWPT ERNO,41.240,2.000,3000,170
00:00:02.60>ADDWPT OFNO,41.280,2.240,4000,200
00:00:02.65>ADDWPT OFNO,41.460,2.240,6000,220
00:00:02.70>ADDWPT OFNO,41.460,2.000,5000,190
00:00:02.75>ADDWPT OFNO,41.280,2.000,3000,170

00:00:03.00>LNAV ERNV ON
00:00:03.05>VNAV ERNV ON
00:00:03.10>LNAV OFNV ON
00:00:03.15>VNAV OFNV ON
00:00:03.20>VNAV ERNO OFF
00:00:03.25>LNAV ERNO OFF
00:00:03.30>VNAV OFNO OFF
00:00:03.35>LNAV OFNO OFF
00:00:03.40>PAN 41.310 2.120
00:00:03.45>ZOOM 5
00:00:03.50>TRAIL ON 1.00
00:00:03.55>TRAIL ERNV RED
00:00:03.60>TRAIL ERNO RED
00:00:03.65>TRAIL OFNV BLUE
00:00:03.70>TRAIL OFNO BLUE
00:00:04.00>ECHO TEST EXPECT ERNV and OFNV follow their large squares and capture waypoint altitude and speed constraints.
00:00:04.05>ECHO TEST EXPECT ERNO and OFNO continue straight because LNAV and VNAV are off.
00:00:04.10>ECHO TEST EXPECT REPORT changes quality evidence only and does not change the flown path relative to OFF.
00:00:04.20>PERFSTATUS ERNV ALL
00:00:04.30>PERFSTATUS OFNV ALL
00:00:04.40>PERFSTATUS ERNO ALL
00:00:04.50>PERFSTATUS OFNO ALL

00:04:00.00>ECHO TEST ACTION Four-minute route checkpoint.
00:04:00.10>PERFSTATUS ERNV CURRENT
00:04:00.20>PERFSTATUS OFNV CURRENT
00:04:00.30>PERFSTATUS ERNO CURRENT
00:04:00.40>PERFSTATUS OFNO CURRENT
00:08:00.00>ECHO TEST ACTION Eight-minute route checkpoint.
00:08:00.10>PERFSTATUS ERNV CURRENT
00:08:00.20>PERFSTATUS OFNV CURRENT
00:08:00.30>PERFSTATUS ERNO CURRENT
00:08:00.40>PERFSTATUS OFNO CURRENT
00:10:00.00>ECHO TEST ACTION Ten-minute route checkpoint.
00:10:00.10>PERFSTATUS ERNV ALL
00:10:00.20>PERFSTATUS OFNV ALL
00:10:00.30>PERFSTATUS ERNO ALL
00:10:00.40>PERFSTATUS OFNO ALL
00:12:30.00>ECHO TEST ACTION Final route and constraint-capture checkpoint.
00:12:30.10>PERFSTATUS ERNV ALL
00:12:30.20>PERFSTATUS OFNV ALL
00:12:30.30>PERFSTATUS ERNO ALL
00:12:30.40>PERFSTATUS OFNO ALL
00:12:35.00>RECORDRESEARCH STOP
00:12:35.10>ECHO TEST INFO Run validate_route_comparison.py on output/pybada-route-speed-gui.csv.
00:12:40.00>HOLD
